MASSLESS STATE INDEX

Membership predicate:
    x ∈ M₀ iff κ(x) = 0 and ρ(x) = 0.

Preservation predicate:
    P_Z(g) = 1 iff L_g(M₀) ⊆ M₀.

Observation predicate:
    O(g) = 1 iff every state in M₀ is observed under g.

The admission API checks supplied massless states; the full-state-space
predicates remain part of the domain contract.
